= Commons — Simple =

A commons is a resource shared by many people under some arrangement for access and use. Shared grazing land, fisheries, irrigation systems, and some digital resources can be commons. A commons does not automatically collapse; governance matters.

'''Important boundary:''' commons ≠ public good.

